   useGraphState, useTaskTopologies, useFileViewer, usePromptViewer) cluster
   around views/*, chat/*, and Sidebar.
 • shared/index.js self-declares its primitives are forks of
   AgentFoundation/src/agent_foundation/ui/webui/react/src/components/common/
   → re-sync upstream.
 • theme/* is cross-app by design — createAppTheme(definition, createThemeFn)
   takes the MUI factory as a parameter to support MUI 5 (AgentFoundation) and
   MUI 7 (OpenStartup); CSS vars injected via useLayoutEffect to avoid FOUC;
   tokens namespaced under theme.custom.{categorical, surfaces}.
 • Two distinct registries documented: WidgetRegistry.js (keyed on AF
   input_mode strings:
   free_text/text_input/single_choice/multiple_choice(s)/confirmation/press_to
   _continue → AF widgets, fallback TextInputWidget) and ChatWidgetRenderer.js
   (keyed on payload type:
