**Description**: Conduct a complete inventory and promotability audit of every UI artifact under /Users/tchen7/MyProjects/CoreProjects/OpenStartup/src/openteam/ui/src. For each component (components/chat, chat-widgets, employees, layout, projects, tasks, teams, views), shared primitive (src/shared/*), hook (src/hooks/*), theme module (src/theme/*), and util (src/utils/*), classify it as: (a) PROMOTE-AS-IS to agent_foundation/ui, (b) REFACTOR-THEN-PROMOTE (note required generalization, e.g., decouple from openteam backend API, parameterize domain props, remove product-specific styling), or (c) STAY-LOCAL (domain-coupled to OpenTeam's manager/agent/employee simulation). For each item, capture: file path, line count, external deps (MUI components, hooks, contexts), coupling to backend (utils/api.js, server-status hooks), coupling to openteam-specific domain models (Employee, Project, Sprint, Task), props surface, and a short justification. Produce the single source-of-truth catalog as a markdown table.

**Todos**:
- List and read every file in openteam/ui/src/components/{chat,chat-widgets,layout,employees,projects,tasks,teams,views}
- List and read every file in openteam/ui/src/{shared,hooks,theme,utils}
