- Document theme-system surface (createAppTheme, cssVariableBridge, ThemeProvider, themeRegistry, ThemeSwitcher) and any component's reliance on theme tokens
- Produce promotability_catalog.md with columns: path | category | promote? | required refactor | rationale | est. effort
