**Description**: Perform a cross-codebase overlap and contract analysis across the three codebases: openteam/ui, AgentFoundation's existing UI surfaces (both agent_foundation/ui/webui React app AND agent_foundation/ui/dash_interactive Python UI plus widget_protocol.py), and rankevolve/src/webui (both src/ and react/src/ trees). Goal: identify true duplicates (e.g., LoadingIndicator, MarkdownRenderer, ChatInput, CommandAutocomplete, StreamingMessage, FileViewer, WelcomeScreen), near-duplicates with diverged APIs, and conceptually equivalent components with different names. For each overlap cluster, diff the implementations, enumerate prop/API differences, theme dependencies, MUI/React version assumptions (React 19/MUI 7 in openteam vs React 18/MUI 5 in rankevolve & agent_foundation/webui), and recommend a single canonical API (props, slots, theming hooks). Also document the alignment between openteam's React WidgetRegistry/ChatWidgetRenderer and AgentFoundation's Python widget_protocol.py so a unified widget contract can be designed. Produce an overlap_matrix.md plus a per-cluster canonical_contract.md section.

