- Read openteam/ui/src/components/chat/{ChatInput,CommandAutocomplete,StreamingMessage,MarkdownRenderer}.js and compare to rankevolve/src/webui/src/components/{chat,agent,common}/*
- Read openteam/ui/src/shared/LoadingIndicator.js and rankevolve LoadingIndicator + any equivalent in agent_foundation/ui/webui
