  app shell (router + pages + auth + theme wiring). After verification,         
  forward-import from @agent-foundation/ui-widgets for one minor version;       
  final deletion at Phase 6 (OQ-3).\n 388 \n 389 Acceptance criteria per        
  consumer\n 390 - App boots; all promoted-component pages render without       
  console errors.\n 391 - Lint/type-check/snapshot/e2e tests pass; bundle       
  delta ≤ +5% of baseline.\n 392 - pnpm why react @mui/material returns single  
  major.\n 393 - No new direct dependency outside §2.2 baseline range.\n 394 -  
  Visual regression diff ≤ 1% on top 10 screens.\n 395 \n 396 Risks\n 397 - 🔴  
  Hidden divergent behavior in openteam chat (custom message types).            
  Mitigation: pre-Phase-5 audit of custom kinds; feature-flag rollout.\n 398 -  
  🔴 Version-skew install errors ("Invalid hook call", two MUIs). Mitigation:   
  each consumer adds resolutions / overrides pinning single React + MUI major;  
  consumer install verification step in CI.\n 399 - 🟡 Visual drift from token  
  re-mapping. Mitigation: migration-codemod per consumer rewrites imports and   
  applies known prop renames.\n 400 - 🟡 Two emotion caches → style flicker.    
  Mitigation: deduplicate via consumer-owned CacheProvider.\n 401 - 🟡 Theme    
  color regressions on openteam dark mode. Mitigation: visual-regression suite  
  gates the PR.\n 402 \n 403 Validation: each consumer's CI passes + manual     
  smoke on primary user flow + screenshot diffs against baseline.\n 404 \n 405  
  Rollback per consumer: PR is a single import-rewrite commit; revert restores  
  local components (still present in tree during the deprecation window).\n     
