  risk |\n 576 \n 577 ---\n 578 \n 579 ## 9. Validation / Testing Strategy\n    
  580 \n 581 ### 9.1 Per-package (library) gates\n 582 - Lint: eslint +         
  prettier — CI gate.\n 583 - Typecheck: tsc --noEmit --strict — CI gate.\n     
  584 - Unit: vitest + @testing-library/react. Coverage gate ≥ 85% lines / ≥    
  70% branches for primitives, theme, hooks, registry methods.\n 585 - A11y:    
  jest-axe per Storybook story + on all primitives, MessageList, Composer,      
  layout AppShell — CI gate (no critical violations).\n 586 - Visual            
  regression: @storybook/test-runner produces baseline PNGs in                  
  widgets/snapshots/; CI compares with tolerance ≤ 0.1%. Baseline taken from    
  rankevolve current production screens.\n 587 - Bundle size: size-limit        
  budget per sub-namespace export; CI fails on regression > 5%.\n 588 - Perf:   
  micro-benchmarks for MessageList append-streaming and WidgetRegistry.render   
  lookup; results written to widgets/bench/*.json (never stdout-only); CI       
  fails on regression > 15%.\n 589 - Cross-version matrix: CI runs full suite   
