- The Python-as-source-of-truth widget contract with CI drift gate is a sound architectural choice that mirrors industry-standard schema-first practices.
- Peer-dep strategy (React 18 / MUI 5 floor with MUI 7 compat range) is technically defensible and explained with rationale and fallback (OQ-1, OQ-11).
- Phases include scope, deliverables, acceptance criteria, risks, validation, and rollback as required.
