  201 - cssVariableBridge — produces --af-color-…, --af-spacing-… CSS custom    
  properties so the Dash surface (and any non-React island) can read the same   
  tokens. This enables the dual-surface vision in §1.\n 202 \n 203 ####         
  Back-compat shims\n 204 - widgets/src/theme/legacy/ exports rankevolve's old  
  names (createAppTheme(name, mode)) wrapping the new API for one minor         
