  parity (≤ 2% diff) in openteam, rankevolve, and AgentFoundation/webui demo    
  apps.\n 322 - CommandAutocomplete keyboard nav (arrow/enter/escape) covered   
  by RTL tests.\n 323 - StreamingMessage handles 1 MB streamed chunks at < 8    
  ms/chunk on the declared baseline runner (GitHub Actions `ubuntu-latest`,     
  4-vCPU, 16 GB RAM; baseline captured 2026-05 and recorded in                  
  `widgets/bench/baseline.json`). The hard absolute number is a floor; CI       
  additionally enforces a relative regression budget of ≤ 15% versus the        
  recorded baseline, which is the authoritative gate for cross-runner           
  reproducibility.\n 324 - WAI-ARIA chat pattern: tab order + ARIA roles        
  verified.\n 325 \n 326 Risks\n 327 - 🔴 Three different ChatInput APIs exist  
  — reconciling on one prop shape risks consumer rewrites. Mitigation:          
  subtask-2 canonical contract + `` wrapper for one minor version.\n 328 - 🟡   
  Scroll-stick-to-bottom regressions during streaming. Mitigation: dedicated    
  bench in `widgets/bench/chat-stream.json`.\n 329 - 🟡 `StreamingMessage`      
  differs in markdown handling. Mitigation: pin to Phase 1                      
  `MarkdownRenderer`.\n 330 - 🟡 Emotion cache duplication if consumer also     
  instantiates emotion. Mitigation: document single `CacheProvider` ownership   
  at consumer root.\n 331 \n 332 Validation: per-consumer demo app boots and    
  renders sample transcript; perf benchmarks written to                         
  `widgets/bench/results.json` (not stdout).\n 333 \n 334 Rollback: revert      
  sub-path; consumers still on local copies; `widgets/src/chat/` can stay       
  (unused).\n 335 \n 336 ### Phase 3 — Chat-Widgets + WidgetRegistry (the       
  contract phase, ≈ 1.5 weeks)\n 337 Scope: deliver the unified `WidgetSpec`    
  schema, Python ↔ React alignment, and all chat-widget renderers.\n 338 \n     
  339 Deliverables\n 340 - `widgets/schemas/widget-spec.schema.json` (single    
  source).\n 341 - `widgets/src/protocol/widget.generated.ts` (generated TS     
  types).\n 342 - `agent_foundation/ui/widget_protocol.py` extended             
  (additive); new `agent_foundation/ui/widget_schema.py` emitter.\n 343 -       
  `widgets/src/chat-widgets/builtins/{Approval,Choice,Confirmation,MultipleCho  
  ice,SingleChoice,TextInput,ConversationTool,Markdown,Image,Table,Plot}Widget  
  .tsx`.\n 344 - `widgets/src/chat-widgets/{WidgetRegistry.ts,                  
  ChatWidgetRenderer.tsx, legacy/}`.\n 345 - End-to-end fixture: Python         
